  "details": "Use VRLabs World transform prefab and follow thier instructions to create your own world placeable object root. \n\nAdd a physbone chain to it like tentacles/ribbions/springs. \n\nSet the physbone world immobile to 1\n\nUpload and then lock the world placeable object in position once in the avatar, then start running aroound.\n\nThe tentacles/ribbions/springs will expirence world inertia even if world immobile is set to 1 or even if the object is locked in place.\n\nWorld immobile does not seem to work period on world placeable objects anymore.",
